The project was part of TOLOCAR's Makers Empowerment Hubs initiative. All learnings and resources presented on this page originate from NGO RE:Textile Group and its PETROS makerspace initiative. The examples describe one makerspace's experience and are intended to support knowledge sharing and replication. They do not constitute universal accessibility, medical rehabilitation or equipment safety standards.

